just as destructive,

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:36.783
- Yeah.

00:07:36.783 --> 00:07:38.083
- [Mark] if you still believe
that's what you deserve.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.210
'Cause like, you're a great guy.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.780
You seem to deserve better, but...

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.020
