00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:21.803
- Thank you.

00:08:22.814 --> 00:08:24.973
And I really enjoy these talks.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.510
You offer positive reassurance, you know.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:31.390
And you help us out a lot.
I'd like the world to know.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:33.690
