00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.223
That's social media, I think, so.

00:09:30.223 --> 00:09:33.240
- That was my mother, she loved to hate.

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.770
- [Mark] I mean, like the
comments on your video,

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:38.760
