00:09:52.153 --> 00:09:53.440
you deserve, so just
'cause you're intelligent

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:56.530
doesn't mean you're not,
there's other obstacles

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.750
other than just intelligence, so.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.460
