00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:02.090
And I mean, you're offering it to me,

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.750
so I mean, that's a start.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.020
- [Mark] I think that rehab
is a great first step.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.510
But talking to a therapist
