00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:31.700
like a proper understanding, you know,

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.030
especially with yourself.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:36.550
'Cause I mean, I didn't
know what I was doing

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.350
and what was wrong and what was right

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:42.730
at the time because, I mean,
I grew up watching people

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:44.830
get beat to death, and all kinds

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.770
of horrible stuff, you know.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:48.530
- [Mark] No, that's gotta
affect you as an adult.

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.363
- Yeah.

00:10:49.363 --> 00:10:50.196
- [Mark] There's no way it can't.

00:10:50.196 --> 00:10:51.029
- Yeah.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:53.703
- [Mark] Excellent, Damian.

00:10:53.703 --> 00:10:55.130
Thank you so much for coming
back and talking to me,

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.167
and good luck with the
rehab, that sounds great.

00:10:57.167 --> 00:10:59.460
- Thank you very much, I
appreciate all that you do for us.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.640
- [Mark] I'm proud of you, man.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:01.473
- Thank you.

00:11:01.473 --> 00:11:02.610
- [Mark] Cool. Thank you.

00:11:04.962 --> 00:11:06.723
- [Damian] That's
awesome, I appreciate you.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:13.020
Hopefully this, this stay
in Cedars-Sinai, you know,

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:18.020
it'll get some good positiveness
in my life, you know.

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.380
- [Mark] But work on what you believe

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:22.460
about yourself, too.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.293
- [Damian] Yeah.

00:11:23.293 --> 00:11:24.126
- [Mark] 'Cause it's not your fault.

00:11:24.126 --> 00:11:25.630
You didn't pick your parents.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:29.890
You didn't pick that guy,
West, to do that shit to you.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.633
It was out of your control at that age.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.570
- [Damian] Thank you.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.120
- [Mark] You have to keep
reminding yourself of that,

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.130
'cause it's very for
you to just decide that

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.110
you're worthless, because
of those kind of things

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.300
that happened to you.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.860
And if you believe you're worthless,

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.891
this is the neighborhood for you.

00:11:46.891 --> 00:11:49.690
- [Damian] You hit it right
on the head, though, you know.

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:52.770
That's, (chuckling) and I
don't understand, you know,

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.280
why I think I'm so worthless, you know.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.880
I think probably because it's
the easiest road to take.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:59.310
- [Mark] It's an easy one.

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:00.143
You don't have to try.

00:12:00.143 --> 00:12:00.976
- [Damian] Yeah.

00:12:00.976 --> 00:12:02.610
- [Mark] No, 'cause
even for people like me

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:05.370
that don't have these drug
addiction issues or whatever,

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.800
you still struggle to love yourself.

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.200
We still do, everybody does.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.600
So, there's always a struggle.
- [Damian] I hope that

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.053
you love yourself, you know,

00:12:15.053 --> 00:12:17.390
as much as I should.
- [Mark] (chuckling) Likewise.

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:19.820
- [Damian] Because you all
are doing a lot of good

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.135
for the people out here,
just to let you know.

00:12:22.135 --> 00:12:22.968
- [Mark] Oh, that's great to hear.

00:12:22.968 --> 00:12:23.801
- [Damian] A lot of people
talk positive about you.

00:12:23.801 --> 00:12:25.389
- [Mark] Awesome. Thank you, man.

00:12:25.389 --> 00:12:27.028
- [Damian] Yeah, thank you.

